    <comment>New package tree-sitter-r 1.3.0 (maintainer pluskalm): the R grammar for tree-sitter from github.com/r-lib/tree-sitter-r (MIT), built with the %treesitter_* macros like the other editors:tree-sitter packages: shared library, -devel sources, noarch -wasm module and -queries subpackage and the Python binding (python-tree-sitter-r). Fills a gap in the languages opencode's highlighter knows; all of it comes from the upstream sources at build time.
INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together with sr#1378101 (tree-sitter, on top of the still open sr#1378013) and the other new tree-sitter-&lt;lang&gt; packages.</comment>
    <requestid>1378138</requestid>
